        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CARGVC19, Ornate Grande Victorian Knob with Carre Tall Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ornate Grande Victorian Knob with 11 Inch Carre Plate has style and elegance. Grandeur's tall plates are just perfect for bigger doors that need a grand statement. The Ornate Grande Victorian Knob with Carre Tall Plate is 11 inches tall and 2.5 inches wide. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-grande-victorian-knob-with-carre-tall-plate-entryset-grandeur-cargvc19entr\"><b>Keyed Entry Grande Victorian Knob with Carre Tall Plate.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Grande Victorian Knob with Carre Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Carre Tall Plate with Grande Victorian Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.68\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CARGVC19-specifications.pdf?v=1704262392\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CARGVC19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
